(## 1. What MedScribe-R-Us is) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(MedScribe-R-Us is a multi-tenant SaaS platform on Google Cloud Platform \(GCP\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(that turns patient?clinician conversations into AI-generated SOAP notes and) Tj
0 -12 Td
(writes them back to the customer's EMR \(Epic, Cerner\) over FHIR R4. MedScribe) Tj
0 -12 Td
(operates as a HIPAA **Business Associate** for each customer health system.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(Value proposition: cut clinician charting time from ~2 hours/day to under 20) Tj
0 -12 Td
(minutes. Every AI note requires explicit clinician approval before it reaches) Tj
0 -12 Td
(the EMR ? a hard product and compliance requirement.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(## 2. Core services \(all GCP Cloud Run\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(| Service | Runtime | Responsibility |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(|---|---|---|) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| API Gateway | Cloud Run | Auth enforcement, rate limiting, routing, Cloud Armor WAF |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| Audio Ingestion Service | Cloud Run \(Python FastAPI\) | Receive audio, validate, write) Tj
0 -12 Td
(to GCS |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| Transcription Service | Cloud Run \(Python FastAPI\) | Call Speech-to-Text, store raw) Tj
0 -12 Td
(transcript |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| PHI Scrubbing Layer | Cloud Run \(Python\) | De-identify transcript before LLM) Tj
0 -12 Td
(submission |) Tj
0 -12 Td
