0 -12 Td
(\(Gemini\), parse output |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| Output Validation Service | Cloud Run \(Python\) | Detect hallucinated facts, policy) Tj
0 -12 Td
(violations |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| EMR Integration Service | Cloud Run \(Python FastAPI\) | FHIR R4 write-back to) Tj
0 -12 Td
(Epic/Cerner \(SMART on FHIR\) |) Tj
0 -12 Td
(| Clinician Portal | Cloud Run \(Next.js 15\) | Review / approve / edit AI notes |) Tj
0 -12 Td
