0 -12 Td
(\(`api.medscribe.internal`\) is the only internet ingress.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(## 3. The conversation pipeline) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(1. **Record** ? clinician streams audio over WebSocket \(TLS 1.3\) to Audio) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   Ingestion; segments are AES-256 encrypted to GCS \(`medscribe-phi-audio-{tenant}`\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   with per-tenant CMEK in Cloud KMS.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. **Transcribe** ? Transcription Service calls Google Speech-to-Text \(HIPAA) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   BAA\) and stores the verbatim transcript in MongoDB Atlas \(encrypted at rest\).) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. **Scrub** ? PHI Scrubbing Layer de-identifies the transcript \(NER + regex,) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   HIPAA Safe Harbor\). The token map \(token ? real value\) is stored separately) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   and never leaves the platform.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. **Summarize** ? AI Summarization Engine sends the **de-identified** transcript) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   to Vertex AI \(Gemini\) through `vertex-proxy.medscribe.internal` over a VPC) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   Service Controls perimeter. Output is treated as untrusted.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(5. **Validate** ? Output Validation checks SOAP schema, hallucinations) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   \(SNOMED CT / RxNorm\), PHI re-injection correctness, policy flags.) Tj
0 -12 Td
ET
